 "text": "Auditor - Clark County, South Dakota\nOctober 18, 2026\nClark County, South Dakota\nHome\nAbout\nDirectory\nAuditor\nCivil Defense Director\nClerk of Circuit Courts\nConservation District\nDirector of Equalization\nExtension Office\nFarm Service Agency\nHighway\nNurse\nPlanning & Zoning\nPublic Welfare\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nStates Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeterans Service Officer\nWeed & Pest Supervisor\nCommission\nCommissioners\nMeetings\nEmployment\nForms\nNotices\nLinks\nYou are here: Home / Auditor\nAuditor\nPOST ELECTION AUDIT – will be held on Wednesday, November 20, 2024 at 9:00 a.m. in the Courthouse Commissioner Room.\nAuditor report year 2022 and 2023\nClark County 2021 & 2020- Audit report\nClark County Audit Report for 2016 & 2017\n2025 pay 2026 PT 74 and PT75\nPt 74 & PT75 2024 pay 2025\n2022-2023 PT 73 PT 74 PT 75 2023 PT 73 PT 74 PT 75\nPT 73-74-75 – 2021 pay 2022\nPT 74 & ;PT75 2020 pay 2021\nAuditor: Christine Tarbox\nLocation: Courthouse 2nd Floor PO Box 294\n200 North Commercial Street, Clark, SD 57225\nPhone: 605-532-5921\nEmail address – christine.tarbox@state.sd.us\nCall the appropriate office to discuss your business needs.\nAuditor – 532-5921 Register of Deeds – 532-5363\nTreasurer – 532-5911 Director of Equalization – 532-3751\nExtension – 532-3681 County Health Nurse – 532-3168\nVeteran Officer – 532-5435 Clerk Of Courts – 532 5851\nSheriff – 532-3822 Emergency Management 532-6921\nHighway – 532-3667\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in",
